// M4 #859 — matters aggregator. The /matters index + /matters/:id
// detail surfaces, plus the /household placeholder backfill. Both
// queries proxy to the new GET /api/v1/matters[/<id>] endpoints in
// ctrl-api. Note: the existing tasks/operations.ts already exports
// a `getMatters` wrapping a triage-style endpoint — we use a distinct
// dashboard.getMatters here that hits the new /api/v1/matters route.
// To avoid Wasp name collision, this query is named `getMattersIndex`
// and the detail is `getMatterDetail`.
